      "widgets_values": [
        "## switchyard 90s shot map (night freight yard)\n\nUnified graph: Queue **Identity (Klein)** once (LTX group starts bypassed).\nThen Ctrl+B to bypass Identity and enable **Shot print (LTX)**. Retarget LoadImage,\nMotion+Audio, and prefixes for each of 18 shots. Optional Wan rehearsal:\n**wan-i2v-shot-lab-example**.\n\n18 \u00d7 120 frames @ 24 fps = 90.00s. Last frame of shot N is LoadImage of shot N+1.\nConcat: `./scripts/utilities/concat-shots.sh --film switchyard --yes`\n\nDo not Queue a 90s denoise in one graph. US-safe local pack only. No score (breath and world only).\n\n**Identity look:** Night freight-yard still in rain. Generic unmarked boxcars sit on wet ballast under a yard lamp. Photoreal, empty of railroad company marks. Identity lock for the short.\n\n### b1 s1 `ez_switchyard_b1_s1`\n- LoadImage: `example.png`\n- VHS LTX: `ez_switchyard_b1_s1_ltx_video` \u00b7 last: `ez_switchyard_b1_s1_last` \u00b7 optional Wan: `ez_switchyard_b1_s1_wan_video`\n- Motion: Shot 1 of 18, beat 1 enter. Night freight yard, generic, no railroad company marks. Rain on ballast. Yard lamps. Camera walks the gravel.\n- Audio: Rain, ballast crunch, breath. No score, no licensed horns from real carriers.\n\n### b1 s2 `ez_switchyard_b1_s2`\n- LoadImage: `ez_switchyard_b1_s1_last`\n- VHS LTX: `ez_switchyard_b1_s2_ltx_video` \u00b7 last: `ez_switchyard_b1_s2_last` \u00b7 optional Wan: `ez_switchyard_b1_s2_wan_video`\n- Motion: Shot 2 of 18, beat 1 traverse. Breath in cold air. Puddles. Generic lamps.\n- Audio: Rain, distant coupling, breath. No score.\n\n### b1 s3 `ez_switchyard_b1_s3`\n- LoadImage: `ez_switchyard_b1_s2_last`\n- VHS LTX: `ez_switchyard_b1_s3_ltx_video` \u00b7 last: `ez_switchyard_b1_s3_last` \u00b7 optional Wan: `ez_switchyard_b1_s3_wan_video`\n- Motion: Shot 3 of 18, beat 1 exit. Stop between the first unmarked cars.\n- Audio: Rain, gravel, breath. No score.\n\n### b2 s1 `ez_switchyard_b2_s1`\n- LoadImage: `ez_switchyard_b1_s3_last`\n- VHS LTX: `ez_switchyard_b2_s1_ltx_video` \u00b7 last: `ez_switchyard_b2_s1_last` \u00b7 optional Wan: `ez_switchyard_b2_s1_wan_video`\n- Motion: Shot 4 of 18, beat 2 enter. Between unmarked boxcars. Gloves on a rusty ladder rail.\n- Audio: Rain, metal, breath. No score.\n\n### b2 s2 `ez_switchyard_b2_s2`\n- LoadImage: `ez_switchyard_b2_s1_last`\n- VHS LTX: `ez_switchyard_b2_s2_ltx_video` \u00b7 last: `ez_switchyard_b2_s2_last` \u00b7 optional Wan: `ez_switchyard_b2_s2_wan_video`\n- Motion: Shot 5 of 18, beat 2 traverse. Gravel, puddles, a coupling clank.\n- Audio: Coupling clank, rain, breath.\n\n### b2 s3 `ez_switchyard_b2_s3`\n- LoadImage: `ez_switchyard_b2_s2_last`\n- VHS LTX: `ez_switchyard_b2_s3_ltx_video` \u00b7 last: `ez_switchyard_b2_s3_last` \u00b7 optional Wan: `ez_switchyard_b2_s3_wan_video`\n- Motion: Shot 6 of 18, beat 2 exit. Look up the ladder. No logos on the car.\n- Audio: Rain on steel, breath. No score.\n\n### b3 s1 `ez_switchyard_b3_s1`\n- LoadImage: `ez_switchyard_b2_s3_last`\n- VHS LTX: `ez_switchyard_b3_s1_ltx_video` \u00b7 last: `ez_switchyard_b3_s1_last` \u00b7 optional Wan: `ez_switchyard_b3_s1_wan_video`\n- Motion: Shot 7 of 18, beat 3 enter. Climb a generic boxcar ladder in the rain. Gloves wet.\n- Audio: Rungs, rain on steel, breath.\n\n### b3 s2 `ez_switchyard_b3_s2`\n- LoadImage: `ez_switchyard_b3_s1_last`\n- VHS LTX: `ez_switchyard_b3_s2_ltx_video` \u00b7 last: `ez_switchyard_b3_s2_last` \u00b7 optional Wan: `ez_switchyard_b3_s2_wan_video`\n- Motion: Shot 8 of 18, beat 3 traverse. Climb continues. No logos.\n- Audio: Rungs, rain, breath.\n\n### b3 s3 `ez_switchyard_b3_s3`\n- LoadImage: `ez_switchyard_b3_s2_last`\n- VHS LTX: `ez_switchyard_b3_s3_ltx_video` \u00b7 last: `ez_switchyard_b3_s3_last` \u00b7 optional Wan: `ez_switchyard_b3_s3_wan_video`\n- Motion: Shot 9 of 18, beat 3 exit. Reach the roof edge.\n- Audio: Wind, rain, breath. No score.\n\n### b4 s1 `ez_switchyard_b4_s1`\n- LoadImage: `ez_switchyard_b3_s3_last`\n- VHS LTX: `ez_switchyard_b4_s1_ltx_video` \u00b7 last: `ez_switchyard_b4_s1_last` \u00b7 optional Wan: `ez_switchyard_b4_s1_wan_video`\n- Motion: Shot 10 of 18, beat 4 enter. Roof walk along the string of dark cars. Rain.\n- Audio: Rain, wind, breath. No score.\n\n### b4 s2 `ez_switchyard_b4_s2`\n- LoadImage: `ez_switchyard_b4_s1_last`\n- VHS LTX: `ez_switchyard_b4_s2_ltx_video` \u00b7 last: `ez_switchyard_b4_s2_last` \u00b7 optional Wan: `ez_switchyard_b4_s2_wan_video`\n- Motion: Shot 11 of 18, beat 4 traverse. A distant generic horn, not a real railroad identity.\n- Audio: Horn far off, rain, breath. No licensed carrier identity.\n\n### b4 s3 `ez_switchyard_b4_s3`\n- LoadImage: `ez_switchyard_b4_s2_last`\n- VHS LTX: `ez_switchyard_b4_s3_ltx_video` \u00b7 last: `ez_switchyard_b4_s3_last` \u00b7 optional Wan: `ez_switchyard_b4_s3_wan_video`\n- Motion: Shot 12 of 18, beat 4 exit. End of the roof walk. Look down.\n- Audio: Wind, rain, breath. No score.\n\n### b5 s1 `ez_switchyard_b5_s1`\n- LoadImage: `ez_switchyard_b4_s3_last`\n- VHS LTX: `ez_switchyard_b5_s1_ltx_video` \u00b7 last: `ez_switchyard_b5_s1_last` \u00b7 optional Wan: `ez_switchyard_b5_s1_wan_video`\n- Motion: Shot 13 of 18, beat 5 enter. Drop back to gravel, splash a puddle.\n- Audio: Splash, gravel, rain, breath.\n\n### b5 s2 `ez_switchyard_b5_s2`\n- LoadImage: `ez_switchyard_b5_s1_last`\n- VHS LTX: `ez_switchyard_b5_s2_ltx_video` \u00b7 last: `ez_switchyard_b5_s2_last` \u00b7 optional Wan: `ez_switchyard_b5_s2_wan_video`\n- Motion: Shot 14 of 18, beat 5 traverse. Walk toward yard-office window glow without readable signage.\n- Audio: Gravel, rain, breath.\n\n### b5 s3 `ez_switchyard_b5_s3`\n- LoadImage: `ez_switchyard_b5_s2_last`\n- VHS LTX: `ez_switchyard_b5_s3_ltx_video` \u00b7 last: `ez_switchyard_b5_s3_last` \u00b7 optional Wan: `ez_switchyard_b5_s3_wan_video`\n- Motion: Shot 15 of 18, beat 5 exit. Window glow, no readable sign. Keep walking.\n- Audio: Rain, breath. No score.\n\n### b6 s1 `ez_switchyard_b6_s1`\n- LoadImage: `ez_switchyard_b5_s3_last`\n- VHS LTX: `ez_switchyard_b6_s1_ltx_video` \u00b7 last: `ez_switchyard_b6_s1_last` \u00b7 optional Wan: `ez_switchyard_b6_s1_wan_video`\n- Motion: Shot 16 of 18, beat 6 enter. Stop under a lamp.\n- Audio: Rain ticking the lamp, breath.\n\n### b6 s2 `ez_switchyard_b6_s2`\n- LoadImage: `ez_switchyard_b6_s1_last`\n- VHS LTX: `ez_switchyard_b6_s2_ltx_video` \u00b7 last: `ez_switchyard_b6_s2_last` \u00b7 optional Wan: `ez_switchyard_b6_s2_wan_video`\n- Motion: Shot 17 of 18, beat 6 traverse. Look down the dark string of cars.\n- Audio: Rain, distant metal, breath. No score.\n\n### b6 s3 `ez_switchyard_b6_s3`\n- LoadImage: `ez_switchyard_b6_s2_last`\n- VHS LTX: `ez_switchyard_b6_s3_ltx_video` \u00b7 last: `ez_switchyard_b6_s3_last` \u00b7 optional Wan: `ez_switchyard_b6_s3_wan_video`\n- Motion: Shot 18 of 18, beat 6 exit. A quiet, short laugh. Hold.\n- Audio: Rain ticking the lamp, breath. No score.\n"
